### CV Peak Validation API Test File
@CVPeakValidation.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5017

### 1. Health Check - Root endpoint
GET {{CVPeakValidation.Api_HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json

### 2. System Health Check
GET {{CVPeakValidation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 3. Python Service Health Check
GET {{CVPeakValidation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health/python-service
Accept: application/json

### 4. Swagger Documentation
GET {{CVPeakValidation.Api_HostAddress}}/swagger/index.html
Accept: text/html

### 5. Upload CV File (multipart/form-data)
POST {{CVPeakValidation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cvanalysis/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test_cv_data.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

Voltage,Current
-1.0,0.001
-0.8,0.002
-0.6,0.003
-0.4,0.005
-0.2,0.008
0.0,0.012
0.2,0.015
0.4,0.020
0.6,0.018
0.8,0.010
1.0,0.005
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="compoundName"

Test Compound
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="electrolyte"

KCl
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="scanRate"

0.1
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 6. Analyze CV File (replace fileId with actual ID from upload response)
POST {{CVPeakValidation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cvanalysis/analyze/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "height": 0.02,
  "distance": 10.0,
  "prominence": 0.01,
  "width": 5.0,
  "windowSize": 10,
  "detectionMethod": "enhanced_v6"
}

### 7. Create Validation Session
POST {{CVPeakValidation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cvanalysis/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileId": 1,
  "sessionName": "Test Session",
  "validatorName": "Test User"
}

### 8. Validate Peaks
POST {{CVPeakValidation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cvanalysis/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": 1,
  "peakValidations": [
    {
      "peakId": 1,
      "status": "Accepted",
      "comments": "Good peak",
      "correctedPeakType": "oxidation",
      "validationConfidence": 0.95
    }
  ]
}

### 9. Export Training Data
GET {{CVPeakValidation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cvanalysis/export-training-data
Accept: application/json

###
